DESCRIPTION >
    - `country_mapping.pipe` provides comprehensive country mapping data including country names, flags, country codes, and timezone offsets.
    - Contains static mapping data for all world countries with their emoji flags and ISO country codes.
    - Includes timezone offset information for time-based analytics and local time calculations.
    - Used as a lookup table by geographic distribution widgets and time-based activity analysis pipes.
    - Primary use case: supporting geo distribution widgets by providing country metadata for location-based analytics.
    - Parameters: None (returns static country mapping data)
    - Response: `country`, `flag` (emoji), `country_code` (ISO), `timezone_offset` (hours from UTC)

NODE map_country_name_flag_code
SQL >
    SELECT
        country_map .1 AS country,
        country_map .2 AS flag,
        country_map .3 AS country_code,
        country_map .4 AS timezone_offset
    FROM
